Let $$A = \left[ {\matrix{
   x &amp; y &amp; z  \cr 
   y &amp; z &amp; x  \cr 
   z &amp; x &amp; y  \cr 

 } } \right]$$, where x, y and z are real numbers such that x + y + z &gt; 0 and xyz = 2. If $${A^2} = {I_3}$$, then the value of $${x^3} + {y^3} + {z^3}$$ is ____________.

